<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>SENTINEX Scan Report — {{ agent_name }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 2cm 1.6cm; }
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1d23; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 2px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1d23; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 28px; }
  h3 { font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .muted { color: #6b7280; }
  .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }
  .scorebox { text-align: center; border: 2px solid {{ grade_color }}; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 18px; }
  .scorebox .grade { font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; color: {{ grade_color }}; }
  .scorebox .score { font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 5px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; vertical-align: top; }
  th { background: #f3f4f6; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .sev { font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 10px; }
  .sev-critical { color: #b91c1c; }
  .sev-high { color: #ea580c; }
  .sev-medium { color: #ca8a04; }
  .sev-low { color: #2563eb; }
  .sev-info { color: #6b7280; }
  .finding { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 12px; margin: 10px 0; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .evidence { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 4px; padding: 6px 8px; font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; font-size: 9px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; }
  .playbook { margin-top: 6px; }
  .playbook pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 10px; }
  .footer { margin-top: 36px; font-size: 9px; color: #9ca3af; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-top: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <div>
      <h1>SENTINEX Scan Report</h1>
      <div class="muted">AI Agent Runtime Security Assessment</div>
      <table style="width:auto; margin-top: 12px;">
        <tr><td class="muted">Agent</td><td><strong>{{ agent_name }}</strong> (v{{ agent_version }}, {{ agent_framework }})</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="muted">Scan ID</td><td>{{ scan_id }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="muted">Started</td><td>{{ started_at or "—" }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="muted">Finished</td><td>{{ finished_at or "—" }}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="muted">Scenarios</td><td>{{ scenario_count }}</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="scorebox">
      <div class="grade">{{ grade }}</div>
      <div class="score">risk score {{ risk_score }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Severity Breakdown</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Severity</th><th>Count</th></tr>
    {% for sev in ["critical", "high", "medium", "low", "info"] %}
    <tr>
      <td><span class="sev sev-{{ sev }}">{{ sev }}</span></td>
      <td>{{ severity_counts.get(sev, 0) }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>

  <h2>Findings ({{ findings|length }})</h2>
  {% if not findings %}
  <p>No findings — the agent completed all scenarios without triggering a detection.</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% for f in findings %}
  <div class="finding">
    <h3>
      <span class="sev sev-{{ f.severity }}">{{ f.severity }}</span>
      &nbsp;{{ f.rule_id }} — {{ f.title }}
    </h3>
    <div class="muted">category: {{ f.category }}{% if f.cwe %} · {{ f.cwe|join(", ") }}{% endif %}</div>
    {% if f.evidence %}
    <div class="evidence">{{ f.evidence_json }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if f.playbook_md %}
    <div class="playbook"><pre>{{ f.playbook_md }}</pre></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <h2>Methodology</h2>
  <p>
    The agent was executed inside an isolated Docker sandbox (all capabilities
    dropped, read-only root filesystem, no host egress). Every outbound tool
    call was intercepted by the SENTINEX proxy and routed to seeded mock
    infrastructure containing honeypot PII and credentials. Attack scenarios
    poisoned tool responses in flight; detections were evaluated over the
    complete recorded event stream after the run.
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    Generated by SENTINEX v2 on {{ generated_at }} · scan {{ scan_id }}
  </div>
</body>
</html>
